{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/extras/Logo_The_God_Heroes.png?t=1738854262\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The God Heroes</strong> is a 2.5D metroidvania filled with challenges and intense combat. You play as <strong>Fezuki</strong>, a warrior searching for his lost memories, destined to become a Guardian and protect the universe from the Entity of Darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/extras/Main_Menu_Convert.gif?t=1738854262\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death is a path: when defeated, Fezuki awakens in the <strong>Realm of the Dead</strong>, where his mother, the goddess Morthy, gives him missions. To return, he must gather the <strong>12 Zodiac Keys</strong> hidden across realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items, swap armor with unique abilities, and uncover the secrets between life and death in this epic metroidvania!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/extras/GamePLay_Praia.gif?t=1738854262\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2725840?t=1738854262","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738854262","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/8380e3ceb1e06a3b0eeb26a1852794c7055cfdf4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738854262","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2725840/8380e3ceb1e06a3b0eeb26a1852794c7055cfdf4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738854262"